{
 "demo_format": 1,
 "id": "example2",
 "order": 2,
 "title": {
  "zh": "例 2：B II 2s2p ³P 和 ¹P，非相对论 HF 作初始轨道",
  "en": "Example 2: B II 2s2p ³P and ¹P from non-relativistic HF orbitals"
 },
 "summary": {
  "zh": "用非相对论 Hartree-Fock 程序 hf 得到初始轨道，rwfnmchfmcdf 转换为相对论轨道，再做 2s2p 各 J 的 Dirac-Fock 计算、变换到 LSJ 耦合并生成能级表。手册中用 Coupling 程序换到其他耦合方案的部分没有收录。",
  "en": "Initial orbitals from the non-relativistic Hartree-Fock program hf, converted to relativistic orbitals with rwfnmchfmcdf, then Dirac-Fock for all J of 2s2p, transformation to LSJ coupling and an energy table. The part of the manual that uses the Coupling program for other coupling schemes is not included."
 },
 "runtime": {
  "zh": "几秒钟",
  "en": "a few seconds"
 },
 "jobs": [
  {
